up_1920x1080_.png"><media:title>Tournament graphic for WVU's last fall event in Hawaii on Nov. 4-5</media:title></media:content><enclosure url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/11/3/GOLF26_Matchup_1920x1080_.png" length="1" type="image/jpg" /><pubDate>Tue, 3 Nov 2026 08:03:00 EST</pubDate><s:sport_id>5</s:sport_id><s:story_id>59632</s:story_id></item><item><title>Mountaineers Open Season in Resounding Fashion</title><link>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/11/2/mens-basketball-mountaineers-open-season-in-resounding-fashion</link><guid>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/11/2/mens-basketball-mountaineers-open-season-in-resounding-fashion</guid><category>Men's Basketball</category><description><![CDATA[<img alt="West Virginia guard Miles Sadler celebrates a basket during the Mountaineers' season-opening victory over Niagara at Hope Coliseum on Monday, Nov. 2, 2026." src="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&image_path=/images/2026/11/2/Sadler-Main.jpg" /><br /><br />MORGANTOWN, W.Va. – West Virginia overcame a sluggish start to rout Niagara 91-46 Monday night at Hope Coliseum.]]></description><media:thumbnail url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_system&amp;image_path=/images/2026/11/2/Sadler-Main.jpg" /><media:content url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/11/2/Sadler-Main.jpg"><media:title>West Virginia guard Miles Sadler celebrates a basket during the Mountaineers' season-opening victory over Niagara at Hope Coliseum on Monday, Nov. 2, 2026.</media:title></media:content><enclosure url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/11/2/Sadler-Main.jpg" length="1" type="image/jpg" /><pubDate>Mon, 2 Nov 2026 21:23:00 EST</pubDate><s:sport_id>4</s:sport_id><s:story_id>59631</s:story